<title>UK: City of Yokohama sets $200 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>City of Yokohama sets $200 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF YOKOHAMA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    18.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.656    PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.656    SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
